tant professor Stuur een e-mail Interested Are you interested in this position and do you believe that your experience will contribute to the further development of our university? In that case, we encourage you to submit your application. Submitting a diploma and a reference check are part of the application process. Applications received by e-mail will not be considered. Acquisition in response to this advertisement is not appreciated. Vragen over de vacature? Neem contact op met Nicole van den Bogerd Assistant professor Stuur een e-mail Sollicitatieprocedure Andere interessante vacatures Postdoc in Neuroimaging, Neurodiversity and Brain Evolution 0.8 / 1 Faculty of Science Researcher / Postdoc Postdoc Sluit op 15-12-2026 Publicatiedatum 26-10-2026 0.1 km How does the organization of the human brain vary across individuals and species, and how has this diversity emerged over the course of evolution? Bekijk vacature Post Doc: Statistical physics of chromosomes 1 / 1 Faculty of Science Researcher / Postdoc MSc Sluit op 30-12-2026 Publicatiedatum 21-10-2026 0.1 km The Broedersz group (Theoretical physics of life) has an ERC funded opening for a 2-year Post Doc position on the statistical and dynamic organization of chromosomes. Bekijk vacature Postdoc in Mathematical Statistics 0.8 / 1 Faculty of Science Researcher / Postdoc MSc Sluit op 06-12-2026 Publicatiedatum 27-10-2026 0.4 km Do you have an inquisitive mind and a passion for Mathematical Statistics? Please apply for a Postdoctoral position at Vrije Universiteit Amsterdam. Bekijk vacature Mis jouw droombaan niet! Stel job alert in Privacy Cookies Disclaimer VU.nl Deze website maakt gebruik van cookies Wij, en derde partijen, maken op onze website gebruik van cookies. Wij gebruiken cookies om ervoor te zorgen dat onze website goed functioneert, om jouw voorkeuren op te slaan, om inzicht te verkrijgen in bezoekersgedrag, maar ook voor marketing en social media doeleinden (laten zien van gepersonaliseerde advertent