ways searching for people whose backgrounds and experience contribute to the diversity of the VU community. Vragen over de vacature? Neem contact op met Maurizio Mazzoleni Assistant Professor Stuur een e-mail Interested Are you interested in this position and do you believe that your experience will contribute to the further development of our university? In that case, we encourage you to submit your application. IMPORTANT: Motivation letter should be limited to 1 page, resumés to 2 pages. Motivation letters generated with ChatGPT or other AI language tools will not be considered. The job interviews are planned in the week of November 23 and first week of December 2026, so please take this into account when applying for the position. Submitting a diploma and a reference check are part of the application process. Applications received by e-mail will not be considered. Acquisition in response to this advertisement is not appreciated. Vragen over de vacature? Neem contact op met Maurizio Mazzoleni Assistant Professor Stuur een e-mail Sollicitatieprocedure Andere interessante vacatures Postdoc in Topological Data Analysis 0.8 / 1 Faculty of Science Researcher / Postdoc Postdoc Sluit op 06-12-2026 Publicatiedatum 05-11-2026 0.0 km Do you have an inquisitive mind and a passion for mathematics? Please apply for a Postdoctoral position at Vrije Universiteit Amsterdam. Bekijk vacature Postdoc in Geometric and Combinatorial Topology 0.8 / 1 Faculty of Science Researcher / Postdoc MSc Sluit op 06-12-2026 Publicatiedatum 28-10-2026 0.0 km Do you have an inquisitive mind and a passion for Mathematics? Please apply for a Postdoctoral position at Vrije Universiteit Amsterdam. Bekijk vacature Postdoc in Mathematical Statistics 0.8 / 1 Faculty of Science Researcher / Postdoc MSc Sluit op 06-12-2026 Publicatiedatum 27-10-2026 0.0 km Do you have an inquisitive mind and a passion for Mathematical Statistics? Please apply for a Postdoctoral position at Vrije Universiteit Amsterdam. Beki